| `NP_default` | 256×256 | 5,5,1 | 0,0,0 | 2/4/2 | 1 | F/F/F/F |
| `NP_Tracks_SimplePainter1` | 2048×2048 | 100,100,2 | 100,100,10 | 2/4/2 | 1 | T/T/F/T |
| `NP_Water_Dense_Sea_Still_100m` | 2048×2048 | 100,100,2 | 100,100,80 | 2/4/4 | 0.6 | F/T/F/T |
