| `NP_Water_Dense_Sea_Wavy_100m` | 2048×2048 | 100,100,2 | 100,100,80 | 2/6/4 | 0.6 | F/T/F/T |
| `NP_Water_Dense_Sea_Wavy_200m` | 2048×2048 | 200,200,4 | 200,200,80 | 2/2/2 | 0.4 | F/T/F/T |
| `NP_Water_Sparse_Lake1` | 2048×2048 | 80,80,1 | 80,80,0.5 | 2/4/2 | 0.5 | F/T/F/F |
